ed gastrointestinal hormones and their effects on appetite in aging.", "MUÑOZ C:Muñoz C is an author who has contributed to the understanding of nutrition in healthy older adults.", "ONAMBÉLÉ-PEARSON GL:Onambélé-Pearson GL is an author who has studied the effects of supplementation on exercise adaptations in older persons.", "RAMOS CORDERO P:Ramos Cordero P is an author known for his contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly focusing on healthy eating practices for the elderly. He has collaborated on various works that address the importance of nutrition and feeding in residential settings for older adults. Through his writings, Ramos Cordero P emphasizes the significance of proper dietary habits to enhance the well-being of the elderly population.", "HENDERSON GC:Henderson GC is an author who has researched the application of essential amino acid supplementation in treating sarcopenia in elderly people.", "HOLICK MF:Holick MF is an author known for his work on vitamin D deficiency and its implications for health.", "LIPS P:Lips P is an author who has contributed to research on reducing fracture risk with calcium and vitamin D.", "JACKSON RD:Jackson RD is an author who has studied the effects of calcium and vitamin D supplementation on fracture risk.", "LAVIE CJ:Lavie CJ is an author who has researched the role of omega-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids in cardiovascular diseases.", "LEE JH:Lee JH is an author who has discussed vitamin D deficiency as a cardiovascular risk factor.", "GIL GREGORIO P:", "STEWART CE:Stewart CE is an author who has researched the influences of carbohydrate and amino acid supplementation on exercise adaptations in older individuals.", "ORTEGA RM:Ortega RM is an author recognized for their contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in relation to dietary records and assessments. They have focused on the nutritional needs of the elderly, providing insights and recommendations for dietary intakes tailored to this specific